{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0068_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0068_story_02_title", "source_sha256": "fd88b91d7d98f030fb35dcc77f5b18990361a9d8b43997e6c9c4d9c6690f789b", "ja": "私たちの旗", "zh": "我们的旗帜", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0068_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0068_story_02_synopsis", "source_sha256": "e70eefd3c4e2646714803e4274d44c3bbc4e88ef699c77b9b79c2d0752e1afc5", "ja": "レッスン初日。曲名にちなんで屋上に自分達\nの旗をかかげたい3人。そのデザインに悩む\nサジタリアスのもとに、突如麗花が。自由を\n振りまいて去っていく彼女の姿に、さらに\n思案を深めるメンバー達だった。", "zh": "练习首日，三位偶像想要效法曲名，在屋顶上\n扬起自己的旗帜。就在『射手座』成员\n为旗帜样式烦恼的时候，丽花突然出现，\n并随心所欲地展现自由本色后便离去了，\n这激发了成员们更进一步思考。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0068_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0068_story_02_1000_p", "source_sha256": "73243d733f9eb08e874c186b5da25482119d5c549d4d962f4a5080963317ff79", "ja": "（今日はレッスン初日だ。みんなが寒くないように、\nあらかじめ暖房を入れて、と……）", "zh": "（今天是练习首日，为了不让大家着凉，\n我先把暖气打开吧……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0068_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0068_story_02_1001_020meg", "source_sha256": "a49dc90e3f436a7bdacb2142523e5245aea63bcc935a06b14e1f6936c7f7a079", "ja": "おっはよ～{$P$}！\nわぁ、あったかぁ～い♪", "zh": "早安～{$P$}！\n哇，好暖和喔～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0068_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0068_story_02_1002_p", "source_sha256": "ca59aebaa7c469a3a3d2f3510d12cb66482d7a84c886209902a0527e5ec53ec1", "ja": "おっ、おはよう恵美。\n思ったより早かった……うん？", "zh": "喔，早啊，惠美。\n你怎么这么早来……嗯？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0068_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0068_story_02_1003_034ayu", "source_sha256": "d08dc85f57118d2c1a724bb1273cfec3d12197bb011657f0bf895da97313849d", "ja": "グッモーニン、{$P$}！", "zh": "Good morning，{$P$}！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0068_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0068_story_02_1004_044miz", "source_sha256": "44aed701232ad0d57634b19682523ecb8f6db020043bd6e26c52b6ea3b25a47e", "ja": "おはようございます、{$P$}。\n……外は寒かったけど、ここはぬくぬくだぞ。", "zh": "早安，{$P$}。\n……外面虽然很冷，但里头暖呼呼呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0068_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0068_story_02_1005_p", "source_sha256": "20298ca338724bf939386d4fe481827ce0f840aa78af9099ef7908985408c310", "ja": "全員、集合時間前に集まるとは……。\nサジタリアス、気合い十分って感じじゃないか！", "zh": "所有人居然都提前集合了……\n看来我们的『射手座』干劲十足呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0068_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0068_story_02_1006_020meg", "source_sha256": "1ee4a0438c657b113498d8a8f92787cb7167facda3986a2bdef0d898a1d145db", "ja": "えへへ、まあね！\n昨日も3人で、いろいろ相談とかしたし♪", "zh": "嘿嘿，对呀！\n毕竟我们三个昨天也讨论了很久嘛♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0068_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0068_story_02_1007_020meg", "source_sha256": "e73fcf651464c9673be000e3fba22eb343702863df0944553dad16f57860ec7b", "ja": "あ、そだ！　レッスンの前に、ちょっと来て欲しい所が\nあるんだっ。{$P$}、こっちこっち♪", "zh": "啊，对了！开始练习前，先和我们去一个地方吧！\n{$P$}，这边这边♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0068_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0068_story_02_1008_p", "source_sha256": "023ca037e1c3760c725f33bacde664951de8d872639f7ac9f6e666fb36c36827", "ja": "え？　なんだなんだ？　3人そろって……\nあっ、待ってくれ……！", "zh": "什么？怎么啦？你们三个……\n啊！等一下……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0068_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0068_story_02_1009_p", "source_sha256": "109f3cbccb7db3461530a8f661e74ddc62fbb1ee22442d0781d36ac025371a40", "ja": "ううっ、この季節の屋上はさすがに冷える……。\n目的地はここでよかったのか？", "zh": "呜呜，这个季节上来顶楼真的会冷……\n你们说的地方就是这里吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0068_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0068_story_02_1010_020meg", "source_sha256": "e469f6c342ac21cfda510af7833c7d8e94e5ddd9b578658543366f9437cdecc9", "ja": "うん！　あのね、{$P$}。\nここにアタシ達の旗を立てたいのっ！", "zh": "嗯！是这样的，{$P$}。\n我们想在这里竖立我们的旗帜！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0068_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0068_story_02_1011_p", "source_sha256": "15b2973b5987f42d1974e11fc446d4e05dd9e98ea95a828a53cb133bc0e5587b", "ja": "旗？　……ああ、みんなに歌ってもらう曲の名前、\n『Raise the FLAG』は、そういう意味だったな。", "zh": "旗帜……？哦哦，你们这次要唱的歌曲叫\n『Raise the FLAG』，曲名的确是这个意思。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0068_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0068_story_02_1012_020meg", "source_sha256": "eb525ef87a3bcc224100f887b3da7ce766c262d10c0c5b2a66ebd4572eb5f316", "ja": "それだけじゃなくて。この歌のテーマって『革新』なん\nだよね？　だから新しいコトしてみたいって思って！", "zh": "不只是曲名，这首歌还以『革新』为主题对吧？\n所以我们就想做点新的尝试！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0068_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0068_story_02_1013_034ayu", "source_sha256": "af3ccbb11da6764fabc4ae867668ffb266ea108d99d603ceb084f24a3b6e5fe3", "ja": "『Raise the FLAG』って、そういうカンジの\n意味だって、瑞希が教えてくれたんだ！", "zh": "瑞希告诉我『Raise the FLAG』\n就是这样的意思！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0068_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0068_story_02_1014_p", "source_sha256": "69ed614147fc5ed74bffa3ff0013d042219c304fa0805dce609ac4214a024351", "ja": "そうか。歩が瑞希に、英語の意味を教わって……。", "zh": "这样啊，是由瑞希来教步英语的意思……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0068_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0068_story_02_1015_p", "source_sha256": "6d5b64e363cdf5f7f2f1aefd3872e8989c77884356599d03be41c94314ef78e0", "ja": "いや、なるほど。いいかもしれないな。\nそれで、どんな旗にしたいんだ？　デザインとか。", "zh": "不过，我懂了，这样好像真的不错。\n那么你们想立起什么样的旗帜？要什么样式的？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0068_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0068_story_02_1016_044miz", "source_sha256": "f395295617fb42fe092520b1498603c6029d2bd0b9abcf11ef7c6c9e2a4723a0", "ja": "はい。クールな旗が、いいなと。", "zh": "嗯，我想要酷帅点的旗帜。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0068_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0068_story_02_1017_034ayu", "source_sha256": "2c00d4705165b33f6432e4298165226df62df905fee0948b8efe335b33cc5e43", "ja": "いや、ダンスな旗でしょ！", "zh": "等等，热舞风格的旗帜比较好吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0068_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0068_story_02_1018_020meg", "source_sha256": "ba3bb8a28efaf49e2359e2b800e125ad02a347d35d92c1706592fc8e4c0b84ac", "ja": "もちろん、オシャレな旗だよね！", "zh": "当然是要很时髦的旗帜啰！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0068_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0068_story_02_1019_020meg", "source_sha256": "021f64244674229a1bc9aba1fa148f0b902ec961a178ec8a09536e6c425d9ae4", "ja": "む～……。", "zh": "唔……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0068_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0068_story_02_1020_044miz", "source_sha256": "021f64244674229a1bc9aba1fa148f0b902ec961a178ec8a09536e6c425d9ae4", "ja": "む～……。", "zh": "唔……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0068_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0068_story_02_1021_034ayu", "source_sha256": "021f64244674229a1bc9aba1fa148f0b902ec961a178ec8a09536e6c425d9ae4", "ja": "む～……。", "zh": "唔……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0068_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0068_story_02_1022_p", "source_sha256": "f3f79544ff8fa63e3096a497dc5b9bf7b76a3734c79dba27fb22e7c080a51c84", "ja": "はは、そこはこれからって感じかな。それじゃ、\n焦らずレッスンを進めながら考えてみようか。", "zh": "哈哈，看来要花时间慢慢想了。\n好啦，你们也不用急，边练习边想吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0068_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0068_story_02_1023_020meg", "source_sha256": "5f4abcc94e5bd6973931f904be59c48006c56adb840bfc683d9e1c6eb67379b8", "ja": "うん、そうしよっか♪　じゃあ早速……\nって、あれ？　なにか聞こえない？", "zh": "嗯，就这么办♪那我们赶快……\n咦？奇怪？你们有听到什么声音吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0068_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0068_story_02_1024_048rei", "source_sha256": "2870120b33391397556e1bfe423ee95e95bc28ac2a8b3f1ab5432bb4f14617bf", "ja": "おっしくらまんじゅう♪　おっされてなっくな♪\nひっとりでまんじゅう♪　ぷっぷくぷ～～♪", "zh": "大家挤馒头♪被挤了别哭哭♪\n一个人挤馒头♪噗噗噗噗～～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0068_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0068_story_02_1025_044miz", "source_sha256": "74f706bfd8da7409665afd916b29b4f93d4f25f0ca9974a7dd9fb68113f09413", "ja": "あそこにいるの、北上さんですよね。いつの間に……\nというか、おひとりで何をやってるんでしょう。", "zh": "那是北上姊吧？她什么时候来的……\n更该问的是，她一个人在做什么呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0068_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0068_story_02_1026_048rei", "source_sha256": "0f4a9846deedbb82b0badc797726cb2969e1a0870514bc36626c5fa562ae96f3", "ja": "ひっとりでまんじゅう♪　おっされずジャンプ♪", "zh": "一个人挤馒头♪没挤到就跳跳♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0068_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0068_story_02_1027_048rei", "source_sha256": "86d7636c13e776c389ac3a425b2a56936a4ff9adb06eca0f4922418631cba304", "ja": "ふったりでまんじゅう♪　ぷっぷくぷ～～♪", "zh": "两个人挤馒头♪噗噗噗噗～～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0068_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0068_story_02_1028_p", "source_sha256": "211dc77123255fb4384efaad50efa81181162c24e09ebde58da82960af58c542", "ja": "わあっ！？　押すな、押すな麗花！", "zh": "哇！？别推啊、别推我啊，丽花！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0068_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0068_story_02_1029_020meg", "source_sha256": "ff0c183476a28878a1a43538cf6e7335aac1c79f2b095f913c9feda9ba0e25b9", "ja": "わあ、大変！　{$P$}！\nだいじょ……ほえっ！？", "zh": "哇，糟糕！{$P$}！\n你还好吧……咦！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0068_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0068_story_02_1030_048rei", "source_sha256": "62ff3cd2afc54e482b81ced3ce5a111c171436bd7bc176dd19b9e26659f137ec", "ja": "ふったりでまんじゅう♪　さ～んにんでまんじゅう♪", "zh": "两个人挤馒头♪三个人挤馒头♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0068_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0068_story_02_1031_034ayu", "source_sha256": "ff543dcd6aad709545b02acb160e66003194c9e1d04eb26145b5dcb735be3302", "ja": "うわぁ！　麗花のまんじゅうに\nみんな巻き込まれて……マイガー！！", "zh": "哇！大家都被卷进丽花的挤馒头里面了……\nMy God！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0068_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0068_story_02_1032_048rei", "source_sha256": "17a0ddbd2de488c3bf47f8529616daee1ea51ceb0143bbe79abc7f4868dd30ec", "ja": "みんなでまんじゅう♪　みんなでまんじゅう♪\nぽっかぽか～のぷ～♪", "zh": "大家一起挤馒头♪大家一起挤馒头♪\n暖呼呼～噗～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0068_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0068_story_02_1033_null", "source_sha256": "efc1d82f27c00c2cd66242ba3968b75b5084f0ad635f478df59f2ea4ca40369e", "ja": "そして……", "zh": "然后……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0068_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0068_story_02_1034_020meg", "source_sha256": "41300ad26dd4d48d800adcaed17790f78f1aa9466747bdb8036c3c99dd373578", "ja": "はあ、ふう。あったまったー！　てか麗花、\nなんでこんなトコでおしくらまんじゅうしてんの？", "zh": "呼、呼。全身都热起来啦！我说丽花，\n你怎么会来顶楼玩挤馒头啊？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0068_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0068_story_02_1035_p", "source_sha256": "6290a2b6d3a08400424551272ed68fdba07d0b824bd78fbfe526f91113579dc5", "ja": "たしか、麗花は今レッスンの時間だったよな？\nあれ、もしかして部屋が空いてなかったか？", "zh": "丽花，我记得现在是你的练习时间吧？\n咦，该不会是没有空的练习室吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0068_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0068_story_02_1036_048rei", "source_sha256": "b6bfaebc7876a9f8071ee6f3761a70ad09b12c64e982cb210286d560ad73c747", "ja": "はい、名探偵デューサーさん。その通りです。\nだからなんとなーく屋上にきました♪", "zh": "没错，名侦探制作人先生，你猜对了。\n所以我就晃到顶楼来啰♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0068_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0068_story_02_1037_048rei", "source_sha256": "38ce42d442a277345b1313ede92c9c2edd9059aa009b21cc8c46cc8ef7bd7a65", "ja": "みんな、旗を作るんだってね。聞こえてたよー♪\n私は自由気ままな旗がいいなっ。それじゃーね！", "zh": "然后就听到大家想做旗帜啰～♪\n我想要一面自由自在的旗帜！就这样，先走啰～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0068_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0068_story_02_1038_020meg", "source_sha256": "777aebf7aa3c890e550819a1746760fe34aae90d0c258d8f8a2f1e6721fd9667", "ja": "あっ、行っちゃった……。", "zh": "啊，她走掉了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0068_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0068_story_02_1039_044miz", "source_sha256": "fc1db7aff6bf498031ae8434f7043c1c51cefd764377a26908edb49fd6d9ff6f", "ja": "自由……自由ですか。自由な旗、いいかも。\nさすがは北上さん。私のライバル……めらめら。", "zh": "自由……自由吗？自由的旗帜似乎也不错。\n不愧是北上姊，果真是我的劲敌……（斗志燃烧）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0068_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0068_story_02_1040_034ayu", "source_sha256": "1a1e35def0de4cb73cb44566b597511893222eabe83e54c4302343cfbca4eb72", "ja": "でも、自由って何？\n別にアタシ達、自由じゃないってコトないよね？", "zh": "可是什么叫自由啊？\n我们也并没有不自由吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
